// =====================================================================
// SCENE 1 · PROLOGUE (Dec 10)
// Anin talks with Dira, Lila, and Kirana, has lunch with the group, and
// promises to tutor Fal after school. While she waits for him in the
// locker room, Fal falls from the top floor. Anin doesn't panic.
//
// NOTES FOR THE PROGRAMMER
// - Every "//" comment is a stage direction for you, not in-game text.
// - Custom commands used below (rename to match your Dialogue Runner):
//     <<enable_control>>              give the player movement + interact
//     <<quest_start "id" "Title">>    start / show a quest
//     <<quest_update "id" "Title">>   update the quest objective
//     <<scene_transition "Location">> fade + load a location
//     <<advance_time "slot">>         morning / lunch / after_school
//     <<cutscene "id">>               play a non-dialogue cutscene
//     <<hard_reset>>                  white flash, loop back to the wish
//     <<fade>>                        short fade out and in, same scene
//     <<show "Name">> / <<hide "Name">>  a character enters / exits
// - Interactable nodes (Dorm_*, Classroom_*, Lockers_*) are started by
//   the object's interact trigger. Node names match the object.
// =====================================================================


title: Scene1_Declarations
tags: setup
---
// Never run this node. It only holds the variable declarations.
<<declare $anin_dressed = false>>
// While true, a SceneDoor with a Story Node runs that node (such as Dorm_Door) instead of leaving freely.
// The game turns it off every time a scene loads; a start node turns it on when that scene's story needs the door.
<<declare $story_exit = false>>
<<declare $lockers_clock = false>>
<<declare $lockers_fal = false>>
<<declare $lockers_hook = false>>
===


// ---------------------------------------------------------------------
// DORM — MORNING
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------

title: Dorm_Start
tags: scene1 dorm
---
// Anin wakes up in her dorm room. Kirana (roommate) is not there.
Anin: Looks like Kirana left early. Not really her thing.
<<set $story_exit to true>>
<<enable_control>>
<<quest_start "scene1_morning" "Get ready for school">>
// First time the player controls Anin. Optional tutorial here.
// Interactables: Dorm_Bed, Dorm_Poster, Dorm_Desk, Dorm_Door
===

title: Dorm_Bed
tags: scene1 dorm interactable
---
Anin: No time to lie around, Anin...
===

title: Dorm_Poster
tags: scene1 dorm interactable
---
Anin: Kirana's favorite band. I don't really listen to this kind of music.
===

title: Dorm_Desk
tags: scene1 dorm interactable
---
Anin: I should hurry.
-> Get dressed
    <<set $anin_dressed to true>>
    <<fade>>
    // Anin showers, rushes through her makeup, puts on her uniform.
    // Play a short fade or outfit swap here.
-> Do nothing
===

title: Dorm_Door
tags: scene1 dorm interactable
---
// Story Node of the Dorm's SceneDoor: runs only while $story_exit is true.
// Otherwise the door leaves freely to its Destination Scene.
<<if $anin_dressed is false>>
    Anin: I can't go out like this.
<<else>>
    Anin: Leave the room?
    -> Yes
        <<scene_transition "Classroom" "door">>
        <<jump Classroom_Start>>
    -> Later
<<endif>>
===


// ---------------------------------------------------------------------
// CLASSROOM — MORNING
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------

title: Classroom_Start
tags: scene1 classroom
---
// Morning class hasn't started. Students chatting, finishing homework.
// Kirana, Dira, Lila sit at the table next to Anin's, by the window.
// Player explores. Interactables: Classroom_Students,
// Classroom_AninDesk, Classroom_Friends (required to continue).
<<quest_update "scene1_morning" "Talk to your friends">>
===

title: Classroom_Students
tags: scene1 classroom interactable
---
Anin: Oh, they're talking about the new K-drama episode. Wait, why did they suddenly switch to theology??
===

title: Classroom_AninDesk
tags: scene1 classroom interactable
---
Anin: Good old desk. I'll miss you after graduation... or not. :p
===

title: Classroom_Friends
tags: scene1 classroom interactable required
---
Kirana: Hi Anin, where have you been?
-> Why didn't you wake me up?
    Kirana: You sleep like a dead body. I tried to wake you up for ten minutes straight.
-> Thanks for leaving me this morning.
    Kirana: I didn't want to disturb Sleeping Beauty.

Dira: Did you guys do the homework for today's classes?
Lila: Oh shiii, I forgot. Dira, pleaseeeee, can I copy yours?
Dira: Classic Lila. What about you two?
Kirana: Ummmm, can I copy yours too?? Pretty please?
-> I've done it many times.
-> I already knew there'd be homework.
Lila: Weird flex.

// Classes start. Fade, fast forward to lunch.
<<advance_time "lunch">>
<<jump Classroom_LunchBreak>>
===

title: Classroom_LunchBreak
tags: scene1 classroom
---
Kirana: Finally, lunch break. Imagine what would happen to us without Dira.
Lila: Dira is today's MVP. Thank you so muchhhh! I'll buy you bakwan at Warmus as a thank-you.
Dira: You don't have to go that far, but I'm not complaining.
Lila: Let's go to Warmus! See you guys there!
Dira: Careful, Lila— waaaaahhh!

// Lila grabs Dira's hand and drags her out toward the cafeteria.
// Both NPCs exit the classroom.
<<hide "Lila">>
<<hide "Dira">>

Kirana: So, Warmus?
-> Yeah, I'll see you guys there.
-> I don't know yet.
    Kirana: Anyway, see you there if you decide to come.
Anin: Alright, see you there.

// Kirana exits.
<<hide "Kirana">>
Anin: Now what should I do?
<<quest_start "scene1_explore" "Explore the school">>
// Player can explore the school. Events that advance time:
//   - Lunch_Warmus (required): trigger by interacting with the
//     friends at the Warmus stall in the Cafeteria.
===


// ---------------------------------------------------------------------
// CAFETERIA — LUNCH AT WARMUS (event, advances time)
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------

title: Lunch_Warmus
tags: scene1 cafeteria event
---
Kirana: No, but it's weird how we've been li—
Anin: Sup. Have you guys ordered yet?
Kirana: Oh, Anin! We've been waiting for you. Yeah, we all got nasi goreng. You should order now, look at the queue.
Anin: Why is everyone suddenly eating at Warmus?

// Anin waits in line until it's her turn (short fade or walk-up).
<<fade>>
Anin: Hi Ma'am, can I have white rice with...
-> Fried tempeh
    Warmus Ma'am: Plain Anin and her tempeh. You really love tempeh, don't you?
-> Tahu and sambal
    Warmus Ma'am: Trying something new, eh? Careful with the sambal, the chilies are very hot today.
-> Gudeg
    Warmus Ma'am: This is the signature dish from my hometown in Jogja. Hope you like it.
Anin: Thanks, Ma'am.

<<cutscene "anin_joins_table">>
// Anin sits down with the group.
<<jump Lunch_Table>>
===

title: Lunch_Table
tags: scene1 cafeteria event
---
Anin: What are you guys talking about?
Kirana: Not much. Just ranking the guys in school by attractiveness.
Dira: Anin, have you been feeling weird lately?
-> Like what?
Dira: I feel like I've been doing the same thing over and over. Every time I open a new page, it feels like I already know what's written there.
-> That's what happens when you read too many books. Look at Kirana, she's fine.
    Kirana: Fine?? Now that Dira mentions it, I do feel like something weird is going on. There's no way everyone gets déjà vu this often.
-> Lila, what are you doing there?
    Lila: Nooo, it's not done! It's for after graduation. You'll see.

Kirana: So, your plan to study art at university, that's still on, right, Lila? You've changed hobbies like ten times in the past three years.
Lila: No, it's settled. I'm going to be the greatest artist the world has ever known, bigger than the guy who conquered half of Eur—
Kirana: Let's stop right there. Dira's continuing her studies too, obviously, that's a no-brainer. What about you, Anin?
Anin: Ummm, I don't have anything in mind yet. Let's just enjoy high school while it lasts.

// Fal walks up to the table.
<<show "Fal">>
Fal: Anin, got a sec?
Kirana: Ooooooh.
Fal: Shut up, Kirana. Um. Math finals. I'm kind of... dying. Could you teach me? Just the integrals.
-> Lockers after school, then the library?
    Fal: Sounds good. See you there, Anin.
-> Only if you pay for my lunch.
    Fal: Deal. Lockers after school?
Fal: And after we study... there's something I want to tell you.

// Fal leaves.
<<hide "Fal">>
Kirana: HE WANTS TO TELL YOU SOMETHING.
Anin: ...He always says that.
Kirana: Always?? How many times have you two—
Anin: Figure of speech.

<<advance_time "after_school">>
<<quest_update "scene1_explore" "Meet Fal at the lockers">>
===


// ---------------------------------------------------------------------
// LOCKER ROOM — AFTER SCHOOL (required, advances time)
// Trigger: player enters the Locker Room after the bell.
// Interactables: Lockers_Clock, Lockers_FalLocker, Lockers_KeyHook.
// The ROOFTOP key hook must be EMPTY in this scene.
// After all three are examined, run Lockers_FriendsArrive.
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------

title: Lockers_Start
tags: scene1 lockers
---
// Hallway empties. Late sunlight through the high window.
// Anin leans against the lockers beside Fal's, two math books under her arm.
<<set $lockers_clock to false>>
<<set $lockers_fal to false>>
<<set $lockers_hook to false>>
===

title: Lockers_Clock
tags: scene1 lockers interactable
---
Anin: Ten minutes late. Come on, Fal. Not today.
<<set $lockers_clock to true>>
<<jump Lockers_Check>>
===

title: Lockers_FalLocker
tags: scene1 lockers interactable
---
Anin: That rocket sticker. He's had it since first year.
<<set $lockers_fal to true>>
<<jump Lockers_Check>>
===

title: Lockers_KeyHook
tags: scene1 lockers interactable
---
// Hook tag reads ROOFTOP. The hook is empty.
Anin: ...It's always here.
<<set $lockers_hook to true>>
<<jump Lockers_Check>>
===

title: Lockers_Check
tags: scene1 lockers
---
<<if $lockers_clock and $lockers_fal and $lockers_hook>>
    <<jump Lockers_FriendsArrive>>
<<endif>>
===

title: Lockers_FriendsArrive
tags: scene1 lockers event
---
// Footsteps. Kirana, Dira, Lila enter from the hallway, heading to the dorm.
// Lila stops at her locker and shoves her sketchbook inside.
<<show "Kirana">>
<<show "Dira">>
<<show "Lila">>
Lila: Anin? You're still here?
Kirana: She's waiting for her study date.
-> He's just late.
-> Don't start.
Kirana: Don't stay too late, Sleeping Beauty. I'm not waking you up twice.

<<cutscene "fal_fall_offscreen">>
// OFFSCREEN ONLY. A sound from above, then screams from across the park.
// Kirana runs out. Lila's locker is left hanging open. Dira freezes.
// No visual of the fall.
<<hide "Kirana">>

// Anin doesn't move. She closes her eyes.
Anin: ...Again.

<<hard_reset>>
// TRANSITION → Scene 2: Gap 1
===
